              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "প্রবন্ধ — prôbôndhô — \"an essay; an article\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মীরা পত্রিকায় একটা প্রবন্ধ লিখল। mīrā pôtrikāy ekṭā prôbôndhô likhlô. Mira wrote an article in a magazine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "প্রবন্ধ (prôbôndhô) is Sanskrit prabandha, a binding together (Monier-Williams), and so a connected piece of writing. Bengali uses it for an essay or an article."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
